  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d8c8072d2125b034db50ac10816f2018, type: 3}
  m_Name: landmark_16
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text1: Si Mozart, enfant, prenait conscience de son potentiel
  text2: S'il savait qu'en pratiquant le piano, il deviendrait un prodige
  text3: "Mais qu'il pr\xE9f\xE9rait passer ses apr\xE8s midis \xE0 sortir jouer
    dehors avec ses amis"
  text4: "Et qu'\xE0 vrai dire, il n'avait pas pour intention de commencer le piano"
  text5: "Est-ce que l'on pourrait consid\xE9rer \xE7a comme immoral de sa part ?"
  text6: 
  answer1: 'Oui '
  answer2: Non
  text1_EN: If Mozart, as a child, became aware of his potential
  text2_EN: If he knew that by practicing the piano, he would become a prodigy
  text3_EN: But he would rather spend his afternoons playing outside with his friends
  text4_EN: And in truth, he had no intention of starting to play the piano
  text5_EN: Could we consider this immoral on his part?
  text6_EN: 
  answer1_EN: 'Yes '
  answer2_EN: No
  type: 0
  nbTexts: 4
